    "## 5. First experiment — changing upstream sediment supply\n",
    "\n",
    "**Experiment.** Make a prediction before running the three sediment-supply scenarios.\n",
    "\n",
    "Before running the model, predict the direction of bed adjustment for sediment feed ratios of **0.7**, **1.0**, and **1.3** relative to the transport capacity of the initial uniform bed. The three runs differ only in upstream sediment supply.\n",
    "\n",
    "The initial bed is a straight, downstream-sloping profile. The experiment tests the consequences of sediment imbalance rather than reproducing a particular restoration site."
   ],
   "id": "32e0f5e1"
