    "### Step 2 — Run three sediment-supply scenarios\n",
    "\n",
    "Compare the change in bed elevation relative to the initial profile. Positive change means aggradation; negative change means degradation.\n",
    "The progress bar below tracks all three simulations and reports the current scenario, percentage completed, model time, and number of numerical steps. It updates while the model runs; the figures appear after all three scenarios finish.\n"
